# Cargo build artefacts per-package
*/native/target/

# loft package output tarballs (per-package, regenerated on `loft package`)
*.tar.gz

# generated native FFI bridge (regenerated on `loft test --native`)
*/native-auto/

# loft build output — test-runner logs, the multi-megabyte wasm cache `zttext`'s
# `--html` build drops beside its page (parity.sh), the doc-example cache.  A `.loft/`
# appears in EVERY directory a loft command is run from, so this is one rule for the
# name rather than a row per location: listing `*/tests/`, `*/src/` and `*/docs/`
# separately meant each new place a command got run leaked its cache until someone
# noticed.  Always regenerated, never committed.
.loft/

# macOS Finder cruft
.DS_Store

# per-package loft dependency lock (regenerated)
*/loft.lock
